---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer class="py-12 md:py-16 border-t border-border/40 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-secondary/20">
	<div class="container-custom text-center">
		<div class="flex items-center justify-center flex-wrap gap-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-3">
			<span>&copy;</span>
			<span>{today.getFullYear()}</span>
			<span class="font-medium text-foreground">ChenYang</span>
			<span class="text-muted-foreground/50">·</span>
			<span class="text-primary">CG艺术实验室</span>
		</div>
		<p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground/80 italic">
			工具是人类肢体的延伸，电脑是大脑的延伸，写作是思考本身。
		</p>
	</div>
</footer>
